{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "tsBuildInfoFile": "./node_modules/.tmp/tsconfig.node.tsbuildinfo",

    "target": "ES2023",
    "lib": ["ES2023"],
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "moduleDetection": "force",
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "noEmit": true,

    "strict": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": true,
    "noImplicitOverride": true,

    /*
     * 工具腳本（`scripts/*.ts`）跑在 Node 上：用 `process.env` 讀設定、用 `process.exitCode` 回報結果，
     * 所以要 Node 的型別。`scripts/` 底下只有 `migrate.ts` 是 TypeScript，其餘 `.mjs` 由 Node 直接跑。
     * Tool scripts (`scripts/*.ts`) run on Node — they read `process.env` and report through
     * `process.exitCode` — so they need Node's types. Only `migrate.ts` is TypeScript there; the rest
     * are `.mjs` run directly by Node.
     */
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "include": ["vite.config.ts", "scripts/**/*.ts"]
}
